<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Winterthur shaeres.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Winterthur shaeres.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Winterthur shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1500 CHF		  PREMIUM	21.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.74 CHF		  GEARING	7.95 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 12.AUG.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	11.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXHCHANGE	 MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1383 CHF</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
